  "id": 0,
  "text": "Let's move on to the next chapter. We said interrupts fall into three categories: external interrupts, software interrupts, and timer interrupts. Timer interrupts are also very important, so we have a separate chapter to introduce them."
 },
 {
  "id": 1,
  "text": "So, as for timer interrupts,"
 },
 {
  "id": 2,
  "text": "I'll introduce them to you in these three parts."
 },
 {
  "id": 3,
  "text": "First, let's look at what a timer interrupt is."
 },
 {
  "id": 4,
  "text": "Now, as mentioned earlier,"
 },
 {
  "id": 5,
  "text": "the timer interrupt is a type of interrupt."
 },
 {
  "id": 6,
  "text": "Right?"
 },
 {
  "id": 7,
  "text": "And it belongs to a type called local interrupts."
 },
 {
  "id": 8,
  "text": "That much is straightforward."
 },
 {
  "id": 9,
  "text": "So why do we call it a local interrupt?"
 },
 {
  "id": 10,
  "text": "Basically, it's because it isn't triggered by a peripheral."
 },
 {
  "id": 11,
  "text": "It isn't triggered by those ordinary external devices."
 },
 {
  "id": 12,
  "text": "Rather, there is a dedicated"
 },
 {
  "id": 13,
  "text": "component inside our chip,"
 },
 {
  "id": 14,
  "text": "a special device called the CLINT,"
 },
 {
  "id": 15,
  "text": "a device built into the SoC chip,"
 },
 {
  "id": 16,
  "text": "and it is this device that raises the interrupt."
 },
 {
  "id": 17,
  "text": "It's called the Core Local Interruptor,"
 },
 {
  "id": 18,
  "text": "which is what the abbreviation stands for."
 },
 {
  "id": 19,
  "text": "CLINT is short for Core Local Interruptor."
 },
 {
  "id": 20,
  "text": "So this thing,"
 },
 {
  "id": 21,
  "text": "it comes with our chip specifically"
 },
 {
  "id": 22,
  "text": "as a device attached to it."
 },
 {
  "id": 23,
  "text": "As for this device,"
 },
 {
  "id": 24,
  "text": "it is responsible for generating two kinds of interrupts:"
 },
 {
  "id": 25,
  "text": "one kind is called software interrupt,"
 },
 {
  "id": 26,
  "text": "and the other is called timer interrupt."
 },
 {
  "id": 27,
  "text": "We can see the blue line and the red line in the diagram."
 },
 {
  "id": 28,
  "text": "Now let's focus mainly on its timer interrupt."
 },
 {
  "id": 29,
  "text": "Now, for this device, we do the same thing."
 },
 {
  "id": 30,
